<figure class="wide-figure">
  <div class="inkling-diagram" role="img" aria-label="One Inkling token is sent to six selected routed experts and two shared experts">
    <div class="inkling-route">
      <div class="inkling-token">one token</div>
      <div class="expert-pool" aria-hidden="true">
        {Array.from({ length: 32 }, () => <i></i>)}
      </div>
      <div class="shared-pool" aria-hidden="true">
        <i>S1</i><i>S2</i>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="inkling-labels" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>router input</span>
      <span>6 selected from 256 routed experts</span>
      <span>2 shared experts always run</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="figure-caption">
    Schematic, not to scale. The grid samples the routed pool rather than drawing
    all 256 experts.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
